Reckless Tinkerer (let me konw if this is too much) - You've never quite gotten the the Mending spell right. Your _Mending_ cantrip becomes _Breaking_.

**Breaking**
This spell creates a single break or tear in an object you touch, such as breaking a chain link, snapping a key in two, tearing a cloak, or creating a leak in a wineskin. As long as the break or tear is no larger than 1 foot in any dimension, you create it, leaving damage.

This spell can physically break a magic item or construct, but the spell can’t remove magic from such an object.

